{"id":"24c4981635","t":"One Day, I Became a Hatchling","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/download.jpg","n":31,"l":31,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling"},"u":1795038719724,"desc":"​”ماذا؟! لماذا يبدو مظهري صغيراً هكذا؟!!” ​تنين يبلغ من العمر 999 عاماً، و كان على بُعد سنة واحدة فقط من الصعود إلى السماء، لكنه قُتل ظلماً ليفتح عينيه ويجد نفسه قد تحول إلى تنين حديث الولادة يبلغ من العمر عاماً واحداً. ​هكذا بدأت حياته الثانية، محتفظاً بذكريات حياته السابقة كاملة. وتحت تأثير ذلك الحب غير المشروط الذي يتلقاه لأول مرة في حياته، بدأ يتغير شيئاً فشيئاً، حتى استسلم له تماماً…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["خيال","رعاية طفل","مغامرة"],"src":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/1/"},"2":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/2/"},"3":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/3/"},"4":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/4/"},"5":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/5/"},"6":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/6/"},"7":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/7/"},"8":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/8/"},"9":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/9/"},"10":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/10/"},"11":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/11/"},"12":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/12/"},"13":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/13/"},"14":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/14/"},"15":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day-i-became-a-hatchling/15/"},"16":{"ml":"one-day-i-became-a-hatchling|/manga/one-day